{"kind":"assert","text":"Decision for request 1fcd6692, item 3 (Hugh, 2026-10-20): jam and the room host become applications under the new layout. There is no host beside the applications. apps/room (the Worker, lanes and page) and apps/jam take the same manifest, discovery, scaffold and checks as counter, lending, grow and the coming sales and market packages. The note therefore designs how a Worker config, pages and the platform definitions fit the one layout, and states in the manifest, not in the directory shape, what distinguishes the room host from an installed application. The examples directory is settled the same way: its contents are applications."}